+# Implementation Plan: Equipment Availability
+
+**Spec**: [spec.md](spec.md) | **Date**: 2026-10-22
+
+## Summary
+
+Add `availability(query)` to `RentalService` in `src/index.ts`, reusing the existing period parsing and overlap rule.
+
+## Technical Context
+
+- Same stack as 001 (TypeScript, `node --test`, in memory, no dependency).
+- Constitution is still the unfilled template; no gates apply.
+
+## Design
+
+- Extract the period validation (parse start/end, end > start) from `price` into a shared helper used by `price` and `availability`.
+- Validate `kind`: `undefined` means any; otherwise must be `'board'` or `'sail'`, else throw.
+- Result: equipment filtered by kind, excluding items with a booking where `b.startMs < endMs && startMs < b.endMs`; ids sorted with default string ordering. Read-only.
+- Export `AvailabilityQuery` type.
+
+See [research.md](research.md), [data-model.md](data-model.md), [quickstart.md](quickstart.md).
