+# Research
+- Decision: reuse the half-open overlap rule of `book`, so an id is listed iff booking it would succeed (SC-001).
+- Decision: sort with default code-unit ordering (`Array.prototype.sort()`); locale-independent and deterministic.
+- Alternatives: locale compare (rejected: environment-dependent).
